        {
          "footnoteId": 6,
          "footnotesEn": "Due to a lack of data availability, the average prices for Regular unleaded gasoline at full service filling stations, Premium unleaded gasoline at full service filling stations and Diesel fuel at full service filling stations will no longer be published after February 22, 2013, with the release of the January 2013 Consumer Price Index. Historical information for these series will continue to be available.",
